    {
      "id": "jia-chen-route",
      "sourceQuote": "或柱中全无一水，戊己透干，支成土局，又作弃命从才，因人而致富贵，妻子有能。",
      "sourceSpan": {
        "start": 2271,
        "end": 2308,
        "unit": "unicode-codepoint",
        "interval": "[start,end)"
      },
      "sourceLocator": "oldid=2294674;codepoint[2271,2308)"
    },
    {
      "id": "yi-summer-route",
      "sourceQuote": "或柱中无水，又无比劫出干﹐乃为弃命从才，富大贵小，能招贤德之妻。从才格以火为妻，土为子。",
      "sourceSpan": {
        "start": 6695,
        "end": 6739,
        "unit": "unicode-codepoint",
        "interval": "[start,end)"
      },
      "sourceLocator": "oldid=2294674;codepoint[6695,6739)"
    },
    {
      "id": "yi-summer-context",
      "sourceQuote": "凡五六月乙木，气退枯焦，用癸水切忌戊己杂乱，则为下格。或甲木高透，制伏土神名为去浊留清，可许俊秀。土多乏甲秀气脱空，庸人而已。",
      "sourceSpan": {
        "start": 6586,
        "end": 6649,
        "unit": "unicode-codepoint",
        "interval": "[start,end)"
      },
      "sourceLocator": "oldid=2294674;codepoint[6586,6649)"
    },
    {
      "id": "yi-summer-neighbor",
      "sourceQuote": "或一派戊土出干，不见比肩，名为才多身弱，终为富屋贫人。",
      "sourceSpan": {
        "start": 6741,
        "end": 6768,
        "unit": "unicode-codepoint",
        "interval": "[start,end)"
      },
      "sourceLocator": "oldid=2294674;codepoint[6741,6768)"
    },
    {
      "id": "geng-mao-route",
      "sourceQuote": "或一片甲乙，忌庚出干破才，乃从才格，反主富贵。若见一比，又主孤贫。",
      "sourceSpan": {
        "start": 23322,
